ablet magic or consumables, either way can lead you to the top of Cube Dungeon. The decision is up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more – treasure chests, statues, traps giving unique experiences!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894250/extras/eb925ad1990c3ca3a45f2b5673489c04.poster.avif?t=1773866722\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894250/extras/eb925ad1990c3ca3a45f2b5673489c04.webm?t=1773866722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894250/extras/eb925ad1990c3ca3a45f2b5673489c04.mp4?t=1773866722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path: play casually and explore the dungeon at your own pace, or push yourself into hardcore hell with higher difficulties. Experiment with different builds, from classic skill-focused playstyles to investing heavily in permanent upgrades. Forge your own escape story—one run at a time.</p>", "short_description": "Trapped in the mysterious Cube Dungeon, you must fight, loot, and survive through dark halls and deadly enemies. This action RPG blends old-school handcrafted style with unique progression systems and hardcore mechanics. Can you escape?", "supported_languages": "English, Ukrainian, Lithuanian, Japanese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894250/fa2cff13d19fef990af4f96ada0d2f0bd2748a60/header.jpg?t=1773866722", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894250/cc41caf25d77cdb5cf207d9c83e6230c83e323e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773866722", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/